      "message": "Naive post-submit drive-by.  I don\u0027t know this code or this API, but is this something we would want to pass by const reference instead of by copy.  i.e.:\n\n  void ACL_Disconnect(uint16_t handle, bool is_classic, tHCI_STATUS reason,\n                      const std::string\u0026 comment);\n\nOtherwise, it seems like we\u0027re requiring a copy of this string to be made every time we\u0027re calling through here, and it could result in a lot of unnecessary allocations/frees depending on usage.",
